WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Dawn.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:05.410
A Martian tripod stands on
a hill, perfectly still.

3
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:06.970
Birds circle it.

4
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.360
The guns failed.

5
00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:09.840
The ships failed.

6
00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:11.260
So what won?

7
00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.340
Zoom in.

8
00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:16.690
Down through one drop of water,
to life too small to see.

9
00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:20.270
Earth's mightiest
invaders, killed by germs.

10
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.970
Is that a clever ending, or a cheat?

11
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.240
In this mission, you'll meet
the science Wells trained in:

12
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:29.470
Darwin's big idea, from 1859.

13
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.590
You'll read a line from the
novel's very first chapter:

14
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.860
"life is an incessant
struggle for existence".

15
00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:39.150
And you'll ask whether that
ending was set up long before,

16
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.890
or comes out of nowhere.

17
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.350
Your mission: decide whether
the germs are a cheat.
